    "Multiply the result by 100%, and that's it.",
    "To calculate how much to charge per hour to earn $100,000 a year: Find how many weeks and hours per week you are willing to work towards such a goal.",
    "Divide 100,000 USD by the number of weeks and then divide that number by the number of hours per week."
